{title: Go Down, Moses}
{artist: Traditional spiritual}
{genre: Gospel}
{style: Spiritual}
{flow: Meditative}
{key: Em}
{tempo: 72}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Em]When Israel was in [Am]Egypt's land
[Em]Let my people [B7]go
[Em]Oppressed so hard they [Am]could not stand
[Em]Let my people [B7]go[Em]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[Em]Go down, [Am]Moses, [Em]way down in Egypt's land
[Em]Tell old Pharaoh, [B7]let my people [Em]go
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Em]Thus saith the Lord, [Am]bold Moses said
[Em]Let my people [B7]go
[Em]If not I'll smite your [Am]firstborn dead
[Em]Let my people [B7]go[Em]
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
